exam: Determine the magnitude of {m.words} {p.ordwords}s of a set comprising {n} {t}.
exam: It is given that {a} possesses {n} {t}, of which {m.words} {p.ordwords}s are green. Ascertain the number of green {t}.
exam: Whereas a quantity of {n} {t} is divided into {p.words} equal parts and {m.words} of the said parts are selected, state the number of {t} selected.
exam: Compute the number of {t} constituting {m.words} {p.ordwords}s of the {n} {t} held by {a}.
